### hilavitkutin-frozen-implementors

Two stores and two visiting orders written against `hilavitkutin-contracts` and nothing else, frozen: once landed a file changes only through a line in its ledger, which the `frozen-ledger` lint holds. `Columns` keeps each stored column contiguous and `Records` each record's cells together, last key first; `Forward` and `Permuted` visit them. A law that holds must hold over both.
